045585 true] [17592186405057 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405057 1084 #uuid "9f675dbc-4798-5a7f-b170-06e1c7c60f24" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405058 1068 #edb/ref 17592186405059 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405058 1069 "q-123458" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405058 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405058 1071 "Which of the following is equivalent to ${\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s,$ where $C$ is the path along the polar curve $r=\\sqrt{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta }\\,$ for $0\\le \\theta \\le 2\\pi $ ?" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405058 1072 #uuid "9debd71f-7b2d-5a32-ae10-ca946736e9d6" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405058 1074 "The line integral of unity with respect to arc length over $C$ is equal to the arc length $L$ of $C,$ i.e.,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=L.\n$$\n\nIn polar coordinates, the arc length element $\\text{d}s$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{d}s=\\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta })}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\n$$\n\nSo, for a polar curve defined as $r=r(\\theta )$ for ${\\theta }_{1}\\le \\theta \\le {\\theta }_{2},$ we have\n\n$$\nL={\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s={\\int }_{{\\theta }_{1}}^{{\\theta }_{2}}\\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta })}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\n$$\n\nSince $r=\\sqrt{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta }\\,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta }=\\frac{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡4\\theta }{\\sqrt{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta }}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the expression for our line integral is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s & ={\\int }_{{\\theta }_{1}}^{{\\theta }_{2}}\\sqrt{{r}^{2}+{(\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}\\theta })}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta })^{2}+{(\\frac{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡4\\theta }{\\sqrt{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta }})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\sqrt{(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta )+\\frac{4{cos}^{2}⁡4\\theta }{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta }}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\sqrt{\\frac{(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta )^{2}+4(1-{sin}^{2}⁡4\\theta )}{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta }}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\sqrt{\\frac{(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta )^{2}+4(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta )(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta )}{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta }}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\sqrt{\\frac{(1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta )[1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta +4-4\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta ]}{1+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta }}\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\sqrt{5-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta }\\,\\,\\text{d}\\theta \\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405059 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405060 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405059 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405061 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405059 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405062 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405059 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405063 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405059 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405064 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405059 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405059 1077 "selection" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405059 1079 #edb/ref 17592186405063 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405059 1080 #uuid "5aaf3974-45a7-5d36-b332-ebb301287f47" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405060 1081 "{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\sqrt{3+5\\operatorname{sin}⁡4\\theta }\\,\\,\\text{d}\\theta " 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405060 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405060 1084 #uuid "ac3d5894-f4c5-5d9e-ab7c-cd4cec7b9228" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405061 1081 "{\\int }_{0}^{2\