}},\\,Q=0,\\,R=2.\n$$\n\n \n\nAs a result, since the positive orientation is upward, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{{S}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}(-P\\frac{∂g}{∂x}-Q\\frac{∂g}{∂y}+R)\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}-(1-\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}})\\cdot (-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}})-0\\cdot (-\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}})+2\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}-x+2\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Consider the lower plane ${S}_{2}.$ \n\nSince the positive orientation is downward, the unit normal vector to the plane is $n=⟨0,0,-1⟩.$ As a result, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}⟨z,0,2⟩\\cdot ⟨0,0,-1⟩\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}-2\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the flux of $F$ across the entire surface is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{{S}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S+{∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}-x+2\\,\\text{d}A+{∬}_{D}-2\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}-x\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405099 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405100 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405099 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405101 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405099 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405102 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405099 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405103 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405099 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405104 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405099 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405099 1077 "selection" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405099 1079 #edb/ref 17592186405101 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405099 1080 #uuid "1886a1f4-707b-5268-9cc1-ed7effda4966" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405100 1081 "\\frac{xy}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}}+2" 1319413953