\n\nIf we denote $F=⟨P,\\,Q,\\,R⟩,$ then\n\n$$\nP=-y,\\,Q=0,\\,R=x.\n$$\n\n \n\nAs a result, since the positive orientation is downward, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & =-{∬}_{D}(-P\\frac{∂g}{∂x}-Q\\frac{∂g}{∂y}+R)\\text{d}A \\\\  & =-{∬}_{D}(-(-y)\\cdot \\frac{x}{\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}}-(0)\\cdot \\frac{y}{\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}}+x)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =-{∬}_{D}(\\frac{xy}{\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}}+x)\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the flux across the entire surface is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{{S}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S+{∬}_{{S}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}S \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}x\\,\\text{d}A-{∬}_{D}(\\frac{xy}{\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}}+x)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}x-\\frac{xy}{\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}}-x\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}-\\frac{xy}{\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405127 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405128 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405127 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405129 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405127 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405130 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405127 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405131 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405127 1075 #edb/ref 17592186405132 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405127 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405127 1077 "selection" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405127 1079 #edb/ref 17592186405128 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405127 1080 #uuid "4cf9dad5-46da-52ad-9f58-b7b22be13881" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405128 1081 "-\\frac{xy}{\\sqrt{9-{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}}" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405128 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405128 1084 #uuid "4e0745c0-c1e3-54ed-89c3-84df7cb535ab" 13194139533500 17592186045585 true] [17592186405129 1081 "-\\frac{2xy}{\\sqrt{9-{